# TYPOGRAPHY SYSTEM

Typography within the archive exists to support meaning.

It should never overpower the symbol, the garment, or the concept.

The archive speaks quietly.

Typography follows the same principle.

---

## TYPOGRAPHIC PHILOSOPHY

Simple

Intentional

Timeless

Architectural

Functional

Typography is information.

Not decoration.

---

## PRIMARY TYPE STYLE

Clean Sans Serif

Modern

Neutral

Balanced

Contemporary

High Legibility

Preferred Characteristics

Medium Weight

Controlled Spacing

Consistent Alignment

Strong Readability

---

## COLLECTION TITLES

Examples

VOID

ROOTS

NHR

DIJLA

ATHAR

ECHO

Rules

Uppercase Preferred

Clean Presentation

Consistent Scale

